    "text": "By Virginian Review Staff ,\n1 days ago LOW MOOR, VA (VR) – During the capping ceremony held Wednesday at Alleghany High School, Carter Nicely (left) and Kiera Lowman were announced as Mr. and Miss AHS 2026 after being selected by teachers and staff. (Photo: Christopher Mentz, VR)\nThe post Carter Nicely and Kiera Lowman Named Mr. and Miss AHS 2026 appeared first on The Virginian Review .",
